        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The Trust will be established by February 28, 2005. The Trust will be a voluntary employees' beneficiary association meeting the requirements of section 501(c)(9) of the Code, and will meet other applicable legal requirements, including Section 302 of the Labor Management Relations Act and the Employee Retirement Income Security Act of 1974, as amended (\"ERISA\"). All assets of the Trust shall be held for the exclusive purposes of (i) providing retiree healthcare benefits to Eligible Participants and their beneficiaries, and (ii) defraying the reasonable expenses of administering the Trust. The Trust may provide benefits to participants and beneficiaries by reimbursing the Company for benefit payments previously made under the Retiree Medical Plan or Retiree Dental Plan. Although contributions are provided until fiscal year 2012, the parties anticipate that the Trust may continue to operate beyond that date.",
            "block_bbox": [
                346,
                207,
                910,
                419
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
