                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "(3) Funding. The Trust will be funded by contributions by the Company or, if permitted by applicable law, may in the Company's discretion be funded by asset transfers from the LTPP. The Company will fund the Trust, or cause it to be funded, with assets of $400 million. Such funding shall be completed by the end of fiscal year 2012. The Company shall determine the exact amount of each annual contribution and when such contributions shall be made; provided, however, that a minimum payment shall be made for each year of this agreement in the amount of $25 million. The parties recognize that there is no obligation of the Company to fund the Trust in excess of the amount set forth in this paragraph. In addition, the Trust may be funded by contributions or premiums from Eligible Participants.",
            "block_bbox": [
                349,
